{"resourceIdentifier":"2391","resourceName":"Gansu Tianshui Afforestation Project","description":"Gansu Tianshui Afforestation Project (hereinafter referred to as “the project”) is located in the suburbs of Qinchuan District, Maiji District, Qingshui County, Qin’an County, Gangu County, Wushan County and Zhuangjiachuan County, Tianshui City, Gansu Province of China, whose aim is to increase carbon sequestration and contribute to local sustainable development by planting trees on the barren or degraded lands.\r\n19,853.31 ha (297,799.68 Mu ) of forest is to be planted by direct planting on degraded lands in Tianshui City, including two suburbs and five counties. All the project sites were previously degraded grassland and barren land. There is no natural renewal and afforestation before the project.\r\nThe implementation of the project would generate GHG emission removals and improve local environment through growing of the trees, increase income of local residents by offering job opportunities from the project, enhance the capabilities of local communities and residents by providing their relevant technical skills and training, and increase local biodiversity as a result of establishing a forest of native trees.","location":{"latitude":34.750000,"longitude":105.500000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-10-27","endExclusive":"2023-11-27","endInclusive":"2023-11-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2391"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tianshui Forestry Science Institute"},{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2391"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2391"}]},{"code":"EST_ANN